  ],
  "abstract": "This is a survey on spherical Hopf algebras. We give criteria to decide when a Hopf algebra is spherical and collect exampl es. We discuss tilting modules as a mean to obtain a fusion subcateg ory of the non-degenerate quotient of the category of representation s of a suitable Hopf algebra.",
